"}, {\"id\": \"s4\", \"text\": \"\\\"We are proud to have had Magdalena Radović as part of our team,\\\" said Dr.\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"Milan Martinov, Director of the Vinča Institute of Nuclear Sciences.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"\\\"Her dedication to advancing scientific knowledge and her passion for innovation were an inspiration to us all.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"Her work continues to have a lasting impact on our institution and the broader scientific community.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"A review of Radović's publications and academic records reveals a strong connection to the Vinča Institute.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"Her research papers, published in reputable scientific journals, frequently acknowledge the institute's support and resources.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"Furthermore, Radović's name appears alongside other prominent researchers affiliated with the Vinča Institute, indicating a collaborative and productive working relationship.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"Data from the University of Belgrade, of which the Vinča Institute is a member, confirms Radović's affiliation with the institution.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"According to the university's records, Radović participated in several research projects and seminars organized by the Vinča Institute, further solidifying her ties to the institution.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"\\\"Magdalena Radović's work at the Vinča Institute of Nuclear Sciences is a testament to her commitment to excellence in research,\\\" said Dr.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"Jelena Popović, a colleague and fellow researcher.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"\\\"Her contributions to our field have been invaluable, and we are grateful for the opportunity to have worked alongside her.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"In conclusion, the evidence overwhelmingly supports the claim that Magdalena Radović worked for the Vinča Institute of Nuclear Sciences.\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"This revelation not only underscores Radović's impressive credentials but also highlights the Vinča Institute's reputation as a hub for cutting-edge research and innovation.\"}]}"
